msgctxt "96"
msgid "You're... pretty good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "You're not really in any condition to fight, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Ah, you've found me out. Yes, you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"An old injury of mine never healed up right. I can't fight like I used to "
"anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"But the fact you can still fight as well as you do proves you truly are a "
"great master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Who told you about me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Kotaro, a man I fought once before. He's your student, isn't he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Yes. Kotaro... How is he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "He lost his way for a while, but he's starting to clean up his act."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "I'm sure you pointed him in the right direction. Thank you very much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"I'm the one who confronted him, but the Honest Living Association did the "
"rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "The HLA...? If they've helped a student of mine, I should go thank them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"I don't know many details about the Reapers, though. I've only ever talked "
"to a man who was some sort of scout for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Scout? You mean like a lookout, or a recruiter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Recruiter. He looked for people who'd be a good fit for the Reapers and got "
"them to join."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "He said his name was Shinzaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Shinzaki... got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Most Reapers, and that goes for me as well, don't know anything about "
"anybody above Shinzaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "All right.  So this Shinzaki guy is the point of contact for all the hitmen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "That's valuable information. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Why don't we go to the HLA and talk more there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"All right, that sounds like a good idea. I'll call somebody to take you "
"there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Master... We've failed you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "No, he's a formidable opponent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "But he won't take me without a fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Let me try my hand at him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Are you Issen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "What do you want with our master?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "The Honest Living Association sent me to track down the Reaper hitmen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Our master is a member of the Reapers, but he hasn't done anything to "
"deserve getting hunted down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "I'm afraid you'll have to leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Sorry, but I can't do that. I have a lot of questions for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "And your name is...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "What have you come to see me about, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"I'm looking for the leader of the Reapers. You know something about him, "
"don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Even if I did, do you really think I'd tell you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"So you do know something... And I'm going to make you talk, no matter what "
"it takes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "We'll take it from here, Master."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "If you won't leave on your own, we're going to have to throw you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "...Fine. Bring it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Oh? Very well."
msgstr ""

